WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.483
Each package owns its services. The root starts them together.

00:04.933 --> 00:09.856
The root manifest declares no services. It includes each package's manifest.

00:10.306 --> 00:12.535
Each package declares its own service.

00:14.426 --> 00:15.541
Start from the root.

00:15.990 --> 00:18.173
devhost merges them into one stack.

00:18.790 --> 00:21.809
The merged stack answers on its HTTPS hostname.

00:24.230 --> 00:25.530
And it stops as one.
